# Build context for the Dockerfile: sources and manifests only.
**/node_modules
**/.data
**/dist
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/blob-report
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
.git
.github
.claude
.vscode
.idea
# Secrets never enter an image (pass them at run time).
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
deploy
docs
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
